; claude: the File menu every application shares, whatever its
; category (see File_menu.mli): New, Open..., Save, Save As..., Export,
; and their dialogs, saving an application's data with
; appkit_document's Saved. First the office apps', then the music
; apps' patches (plan_synth_teaching.md).
;
; Unlike appkit_document it needs the toolkit and the playground (its
; dialogs are drawn, and Playground_platform is where files go); a
; private library, installed as part of elm_playground.
(library
 (name appkit_file_menu)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries
   elm_core
   elm_playground
   caps ; the authority to save (plan_caps.md)
   gui
   appkit_document ; Saved
 )
)
